		X-Live SFT


X-Live SFT contains bilingual conversational trajectories for training a
foreground agent that keeps talking naturally while controlling asynchronous
background tasks. The agent uses four task operations:

delegate(task): start an independent background task;
update(task_id, instruction): modify a running task;
inspect(task_id): query a task when the user asks for its status;
cancel(task_id): stop a running task.

