		Qwen4-Max Agentic Trajectories


These are multi-turn, tool-calling agent trajectories with reasoning, generated by Qwen4-Max acting as the agent across twelve agentic environments. The environments cover:

simulated service worlds, including SQL-backed tool worlds;
MCP office and web tools;
document editing;
simulated users and tools, including multi-turn customer-service conversations;
offline deep research;
